          "author": "Raccoon Research Labs",
          "description": "Magically turn your Yoto player into a jet plane scanner that finds planes in the skies around you and teaches you all about them and the faraway destinations they are headed.\n\nThis is a connected card, which means it requires an internet connection on your Yoto player to play. The card uses AI to create the live voice audio, but all content is from safe, professional sources and curated by humans.\n\nLearn more at dreamingofajetplane.com\n\nThis card was made by an Independent Developer; visit yoto.space/developers to find out more",
